    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR ON BUSINESS MANAGEMENT (2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的設計主要是開放給已修畢企業管理專題研討(一)的同學修習，課程設計是以碩一上修習之企業研究方法之理論為基礎，結合最新研究與企業發展，於課堂進行研討。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed for students who finished seminar on business management (1). Under the theory of business research methodology for the basis, combining the latest research and development of industries to discuss in the class.\nThe content of the course is designed with academic research and practical case analysis. The purpose is to cultivate the students’ abilities and to analyze the high-level and practical topics of related management research.\n",
